  data: {
    LLM: 'Protect Tarots; try to excuse the Fool before the last trick. Declare combinations you hold to collect marques.\n\nCount trumps and high cards; time when to play Tarots to avoid capture. Save a high trump for Ultimo when you have King or Trump I.\n\nMaximise declarations (Tarots, Kings+Fool, Triomphes, Imperials, Brizigole, Tous les trois) before play; manage card points so you finish above 25; avoid losing Tarots in tricks.',
